1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Bhai ye repository galti se kisi galat aadmi ke haath na lag jaaye.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,960
Kyunki is repository ka use karke aap kisi ka bhi voice clone kar sakte ho.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:12,040
Chahe wo aap ho jao, ya aapke family members ho jaayein, ya aapke friends ho jaayein. Kisi ka bhi.

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:18,800
To bhai ye hai VoiceStudio. Ye ek aisi GitHub repository hai jiske help se aap kisi bhi awaaz ko easily clone kar sakte ho.

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,520
Aur iski sabse badi baat, ye completely open source aur free hai.

6
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,000
Upar se iske liye koi API key ki need nahi hai.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,600
Ye aapke laptop par hi chalta hai.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,560
Aur iske andar bhi bahut saare voices already available hain.

9
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:32,920
Agar aapko story ke liye chahiye, to aap voice generate bhi kara sakte ho.

10
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:36,000
Is GitHub repository pe jao, wahan se ise install karo.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,440
Ye aapke laptop ko verify karega.

12
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,200
Aur phir bas cloning chalu kar do.

13
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,800
Agar iska link chahiye to comment kar do link, aur poora setup guide aapke DM mein aa jaayega.
